{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2022-12-05 09:45:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS APPOINTS JIM LUCAS AS VICE PRESIDENT, INVESTOR RELATIONS', 'text': 'CORK, IRELAND , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JOHNSON CONTROLS INTERNATIONAL PLC (NYSE: JCI), THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS, HAS NAMED JIM LUCAS AS VICE PRESIDENT, INVESTOR RELATIONS, EFFECTIVE TODAY. "I AM THRILLED TO WELCOME JIM TO OUR TEAM.'}